exports[`ACR(앵커 축 on) — job_id 가 없어 run 축으로 붙는다 > latestAcrPromptRunIds · 기간 없음 1`] = `
{
  "params": [],
  "text": "(
    SELECT DISTINCT ON (x.prompt_id, x.target, x.region) x.prompt_run_id
    FROM (
      SELECT DISTINCT prompt_run_id, run_id, prompt_id, target, region, measured_at
      FROM scope_acr_rollups
    ) x
    WHERE true AND x.run_id IN (SELECT ca.run_id FROM scope_answer_cycle_anchors ca WHERE ca.round_date = (SELECT max(ca2.round_date) FROM scope_answer_cycle_anchors ca2 WHERE ca2.surface = 'standard' AND ca2.view_anchor_date IS NOT NULL
      AND ca2.view_anchor_date <= hmg_anchor_today() AND true AND (ca2.surface = 'project' OR EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM summary_cycles sc
     WHERE sc.cycle_id = ca2.cycle_id
       AND sc.fleet_visible
       AND sc.view_anchor_at IS NOT NULL AND sc.view_anchor_at <= now()
       AND sc.active_generation_id IS NOT NULL
  ))) AND ca.view_anchor_date IS NOT NULL
      AND ca.view_anchor_date <= hmg_anchor_today() AND true AND (ca.surface = 'project' OR EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM summary_cycles sc
     WHERE sc.cycle_id = ca.cycle_id
       AND sc.fleet_visible
       AND sc.view_anchor_at IS NOT NULL AND sc.view_anchor_at <= now()
       AND sc.active_generation_id IS NOT NULL
  )))
    ORDER BY x.prompt_id, x.target, x.region, x.measured_at DESC
  )",
}
`;

exports[`answerWhere(앵커 축 on) — project / website 표면 > project · 기간 없음 — 최신 회차 하나 1`] = `
{
  "params": [
    [
      "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    ],
    [
      "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
    ],
  ],
  "text": "a.status = 'completed' AND true AND a.job_id IN (
    SELECT DISTINCT ON (ca.round_date, a.prompt_id, a.target, a.region) a.job_id
    FROM scope_answers a
    JOIN scope_runs r ON r.run_id = a.run_id JOIN scope_answer_cycle_anchors ca ON ca.job_id = a.job_id
    WHERE r.project_id = ANY($1::uuid[])
      AND r.status IN ('completed', 'partial_failed')
      AND a.status = 'completed' AND ca.round_date = (SELECT max(ca2.round_date) FROM scope_answer_cycle_anchors ca2 WHERE ca2.project_id = ANY($2::uuid[]) AND ca2.view_anchor_date IS NOT NULL
      AND ca2.view_anchor_date <= hmg_anchor_today() AND true AND (ca2.surface = 'project' OR EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM summary_cycles sc
     WHERE sc.cycle_id = ca2.cycle_id
       AND sc.fleet_visible
       AND sc.view_anchor_at IS NOT NULL AND sc.view_anchor_at <= now()
       AND sc.active_generation_id IS NOT NULL
  ))) AND ca.view_anchor_date IS NOT NULL
      AND ca.view_anchor_date <= hmg_anchor_today() AND true AND (ca.surface = 'project' OR EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM summary_cycles sc
     WHERE sc.cycle_id = ca.cycle_id
       AND sc.fleet_visible
       AND sc.view_anchor_at IS NOT NULL AND sc.view_anchor_at <= now()
       AND sc.active_generation_id IS NOT NULL
  )) AND ca.is_default_engine
    ORDER BY ca.round_date, a.prompt_id, a.target, a.region, ca.measured_at_orig DESC, a.job_id DESC
  )",
}
`;

